      <p>In 2021 we resequenced two additional wombat populations and recovered the same selected sites.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec007" sec-type="discussion">
      <title>Discussion</title>
      <p>Convergent selection on <italic>BRW1</italic>, <italic>DIG2</italic> and <italic>CLAW3</italic> suggests a shared developmental route to fossoriality.</p>
